  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『魔神創造伝ワタル』より雷神丸が登場！",
      "en": "Raijinmaru appears from “Mashin Souzouden Wataru”!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "風神丸と対になるような姿をしている、御羅院が乗りこむ魔神！",
      "en": "A demon god that Gorain rides, which looks like a counterpart to Fujinmaru!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 部位ごとにパーツを分けられるシリーズ共通フレームを採用。他の魔神と組み合わせて遊ぼう！",
      "en": "• Adopts a common frame across the series that allows parts to be separated by area. Let's play in combination with other genies!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パチパチと手で外せるタッチゲート仕様。接着剤無しで組み立てられる！",
      "en": "• Touch gate design that can be removed by hand. Can be assembled without adhesive!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 背部の雷神の鼓や、雷鳴剣はクリアパーツで再現！",
      "en": "• The thunder god's drum and thunder sword on the back are reproduced with clear parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 2本の雷鳴剣は繋げて太刀へ変形可能！",
      "en": "• Two thunder swords can be connected and transformed into a long sword!"
    }
  ],
